@startuml UC04_Sequence
' Reconstructed from the existing UC-04_sequence.png; no original .drawio was supplied.
title UC-04 — Corgi Customization\nAppearance and cosmetic items without functional effects
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #18314E
  LifeLineBorderColor #92A9BD
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF0F8
  ParticipantBorderColor #326B9A
  GroupBackgroundColor #F2F7FC
  GroupBorderColor #8EA9C4
}
actor Player as P
participant "Frontend\nCustomization pop-up" as FE
participant "Backend\nGame logic" as BE
participant "Database\nSaved state" as DB

P -> FE: 1. Open visual customization
FE -> BE: 2. Request saved visual choices
BE -> DB: 3. Read appearance + visual items
DB --> BE: 4. Saved selections
BE --> FE: 5. Available options

loop Until player confirms, discards or leaves
  P -> FE: 6. Change body / visual item
  FE --> P: 7. Corgi preview only; stats unchanged
end

alt Save selected changes
  P -> FE: 8. Confirm appearance + visual items
  FE -> BE: 9. Save visual selection only
  BE -> DB: 10. Validate and store
  BE --> FE: 11. Save success or failure
  FE --> P: 12. Confirm success only if saved
else Leave without saving
  note over P,BE
    On exit with pending changes, offer
    Save / Discard / Continue editing.
  end note
end
note over P,DB: UC-04 affects visuals only; functional effects remain unchanged.
@enduml
